        ID:
          m_Value0: 7318218563479642013
          m_Value1: 11854001241610856076
        Parents: []
        PortModels: []
        Text: 'TODO:

          put something here that reduces RadiusFromSound as
          FootstepHeardCount increases!!!!


          This is to fix bug where monster
          stands still when hearing footsteps as it is within the radius from sound,
          so it has nothing to do and stands still

          Maybe make new RadiusFromSound
          be effected by distance inside radius from sound??? so that monster always
          moves a little'
    - rid: 7338464985533383492
      type: {class: StickyNoteModel, ns: Unity.Behavior.GraphFramework, asm: Unity.Behavior.GraphFramework}
