        ID:
          m_Value0: 5082241524532464350
          m_Value1: 5855318614596673308
        Parents: []
        PortModels: []
        Text: 'ALTERNATIVE:

          in the abort branch (when monster gets close
          enough to sound) add "move monster slightly towards sound"

          Would
          this achieve the same effect but with much less effort???????'
